 & k \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 0)i-(2\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 1)j+(2\\cdot 0-0\\cdot 1)k \\\\  & =-4j \\\\  & =⟨0,-4,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AC}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16} \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,ABC$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{4}{2}=2.\n$$" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530840 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{1189}}{2}" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530840 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530840 1083 #uuid "e4aceeab-78d8-50bf-9f5d-807f902ca96c" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530841 1080 "3\\sqrt{293}" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530841 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530841 1083 #uuid "e52a06ff-7083-59c8-93fa-6b556c31ac82" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530842 1080 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2622}}{2}" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530842 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530842 1083 #uuid "e57f1b1e-4cb0-5b42-b369-e443920b1d6d" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530843 1080 "\\frac{3\\sqrt{462}}{2}" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530843 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530843 1083 #uuid "e6422438-4494-58a7-8306-ef2b2c61dc7e" 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530844 1068 #edb/ref 17592186530830 13194139535828 17592186045443 true] [17592186530844 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 